<span class="line"><span style="color:#FFCB6B;">pnpm</span><span style="color:#BABED8;"> </span><span style="color:#C3E88D;">dlx</span><span style="color:#BABED8;"> </span><span style="color:#C3E88D;">degit</span><span style="color:#BABED8;"> </span><span style="color:#C3E88D;">importantimport/urara</span><span style="color:#BABED8;"> </span><span style="color:#C3E88D;">my-blog</span><span style="color:#BABED8;"> </span><span style="color:#89DDFF;">&amp;&amp;</span><span style="color:#BABED8;"> </span><span style="color:#82AAFF;">cd</span><span style="color:#BABED8;"> </span><span style="color:#C3E88D;">my-blog</span><span style="color:#BABED8;"> </span><span style="color:#676E95;font-style:italic;"># 在當前目錄新建 my-blog 并下載到該文件夾，然後進入</span></span>
